   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Orientation and directions",
     "texto": [
      "To ask for directions in the street, you begin with «Pardon, waar is...?» (Excuse me, where is...?). The basic directions are «rechtdoor» (straight ahead), «linksaf slaan» or «links» (turn left), «rechtsaf slaan» or «rechts» (turn right). The separable verb «oversteken» means to cross: «steek de straat over» (cross the street)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
